# ===================================================================
# IMPORTANT NOTES:
# ===================================================================
# 
# - Never commit this file to Git (it's already in .gitignore)
# - The app password should have NO SPACES (I've removed them above)
# - If emails aren't sending, check:
#   1. App password is correct
#   2. 2-Step Verification is enabled in Google Account
#   3. "Less secure app access" is NOT needed (app passwords bypass this)
#   4. Check the terminal for any error messages
# 
# - To generate a new App Password:
#   1. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/security
#   2. Enable 2-Step Verification (if not already enabled)
#   3. Search for "App passwords"
#   4. Generate a new password for "Mail"
#   5. Copy the 16-character password (without spaces)
